{"aihot_items":[{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3sq44w01v7ro82l278pl7v","source":"AI HOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cms3sq44w01v7ro82l278pl7v","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3sq44w01v7ro82l278pl7v","published_at":"2026-07-27T22:26:00.307000Z","ref":"A1","score":61,"selected":true,"source":"Anthropic：Newsroom（网页）","summary":"Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei 明确表示公司从未主张禁止开源权重模型，并认为不具备危险能力的开源权重模型是公共产品。他提出三项实际措施：对华芯片出口管制、打击工业级知识蒸馏、对所有足够强大的模型进行强制性安全测试。Amodei 指出，保护主义禁令无法解决其最担忧的国家安全威胁，包括威权政府利用更强大 AI 实现军事优势或深度监控。","title":"Anthropic 澄清立场：从未主张全面禁止开源权重模型，支持芯片出口管制与安全测试","title_en":"Our position on open-weights models","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/news/position-open-weights-models"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3m8ubg001nrox37oixfg2e","source":"AI HOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cms3m8ubg001nrox37oixfg2e","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3m8ubg001nrox37oixfg2e","published_at":"2026-07-27T19:08:51Z","ref":"A2","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","summary":"OpenAI 分析超 80 万条与工作相关的 ChatGPT 消息后发现，43.5% 的岗位特定查询涉及另一职业，营销和工程任务交叉最多。用户用 AI 处理合同审查、数据分析、网站故障排查等原由专家负责的工作。OpenAI 认为这是岗位职责正在变化的早期信号，该趋势在缺乏专业团队的小公司尤为明显。","title":"OpenAI 称越来越多员工用 ChatGPT 做其他岗位的工作","title_en":"OpenAI says more workers are using ChatGPT to do other people's jobs","url":"https://the-decoder.com/openai-says-more-workers-are-using-chatgpt-to-do-other-peoples-jobs"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3lggqj00c0roskhu1r5f09","source":"AI HOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cms3lggqj00c0roskhu1r5f09","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3lggqj00c0roskhu1r5f09","published_at":"2026-07-27T18:45:20Z","ref":"A3","score":73,"selected":true,"source":"X：Kimi.ai (@Kimi_Moonshot)","summary":"Kimi.ai 发布 PerceptionBench，一个从当前前沿模型在 42 个基准上的失败模式中归纳出的视觉感知基准。该基准将视觉感知拆解为 10 种原子能力，并构建了 3000 道验证题，每道题只考察单一感知能力，无需推理或外部知识。","title":"Kimi 发布视觉感知基准 PerceptionBench","title_en":"We are releasing PerceptionBench， a benchmark that isolates visual perception and evaluates it as a …","url":"https://x.com/Kimi_Moonshot/status/2081813202514681878"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3k7su000n8roiytkztsme7","source":"AI HOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cms3k7su000n8roiytkztsme7","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3k7su000n8roiytkztsme7","published_at":"2026-07-27T18:08:24Z","ref":"A4","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"MarkTechPost（RSS）","summary":"本教程基于Anthropic的financial-services仓库，用纯Python复现其技能驱动架构。通过解析SKILL.md文件构建可搜索技能注册表，并创建可复用SkillAgent，将金融分析剧本注入Anthropic Messages API，支持迭代工具调用循环。","title":"用Claude和Python构建技能驱动的金融分析智能体","title_en":"Designing Skill-Driven Financial Analysis Agents with Claude， Python， MCP Connectors， and Automated Deliverables","url":"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/07/27/designing-skill-driven-financial-analysis-agents-with-claude-python-mcp-connectors-and-automated-deliverables"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3n5wpl001sro82iax01xu3","source":"AI HOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cms3n5wpl001sro82iax01xu3","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3n5wpl001sro82iax01xu3","published_at":"2026-07-27T18:00:00Z","ref":"A5","score":74,"selected":true,"source":"GitHub Blog","summary":"GitHub Copilot 推出\"Harness\"工作流，让开发者通过单一 AI 工具完成从原型设计、规划、实现到代码审查的完整软件开发流程，无需追逐多种新 AI 工具。该工作流强调实用性与集成性，旨在减少工具切换带来的效率损耗。","title":"GitHub Copilot 发布\"Harness\"工作流：用单一工具完成原型、规划、实现与代码审查","title_en":"The harness is all you need （mostly）","url":"https://github.blog/ai-and-ml/github-copilot/the-harness-is-all-you-need-mostly"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3ivlee000oroiy8dntgvq9","source":"AI HOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cms3ivlee000oroiy8dntgvq9","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3ivlee000oroiy8dntgvq9","published_at":"2026-07-27T17:50:17.260000Z","ref":"A6","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"LMSYS：Blog（Chatbot Arena 团队）","summary":"SGLang 和 Miles 为月之暗面开源的 2.8T 参数模型 Kimi K3 提供发布当日支持，分别负责推理和 RL 训练。K3 采用 69 层 KDA 线性注意力与 24 层 MLA 交错的混合架构，在 SGLang 上单卡 batch-1 解码速度达约 113 tok/s，结合 DSpark 推测解码可达约 423 tok/s。","title":"SGLang 和 Miles 为月之暗面 2.8T 参数 Kimi K3 模型提供发布当日支持","title_en":"Blog SGLang and Miles Add Day-0 Support for Kimi K3 We are excited to announce Day-0 support for Kimi K3 in SGLang and Miles. K3 is the first open-source model in the 3-trillion-parameter class， and its hybrid architecture departs from convention in al… SGLang Team","url":"https://www.lmsys.org/blog/2026-07-27-kimi-k3-day0-support"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3gqf3h01y1rondsl8z5sxy","source":"AI HOT"},"category":"tip","id":"cms3gqf3h01y1rondsl8z5sxy","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3gqf3h01y1rondsl8z5sxy","published_at":"2026-07-27T16:00:00Z","ref":"A7","score":68,"selected":true,"source":"GitHub Blog","summary":"GitHub Copilot app 将 AI 编码工具升级为多 Agent 会话工作区，支持同时管理多个任务线程而不丢失进度。用户可为每个会话绑定项目上下文，通过 `/create-canvas` 命令在浏览器 Canvas 中预览 UI 并直接点选修改，还能启用 Agent Merge 自动处理 PR 审查反馈和合并冲突。","title":"GitHub Copilot app 入门指南：多 Agent 会话工作区与 Canvas 预览","title_en":"GitHub Copilot app for Beginners： Getting started","url":"https://github.blog/ai-and-ml/github-copilot/github-copilot-app-for-beginners-getting-started"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3fuyes00mjrond2ldww2oa","source":"AI HOT"},"category":"industry","id":"cms3fuyes00mjrond2ldww2oa","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cms3fuyes00mjrond2ldww2oa","published_at":"2026-07-27T15:57:12Z","ref":"A8","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"Google AI Overviews 在搜索结果中的出现率一年内从15%升至43%，AI Mode月访问量从1.26亿增至2.79亿。用户搜索长度增加，正从短关键词转向更长的自然对话式查询。","title":"Google AI Overviews 搜索结果出现率升至43%","title_en":"Google's AI search is rapidly becoming the default， new data shows","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/27/googles-ai-search-is-rapidly-becoming-the-default-new-data-shows"},{"attribution"